- Follow existing adapter handling style in `apps/trackcluster-can-sender/app.py` (`gs_usb`, `slcan`, `seeedstudio`, vendor interfaces).
- Keep CAN payload validation strict (`11-bit ID`, `8-byte payload`) before transmit.
- Keep CLI scripts small, explicit, and usage-driven like `rd-build/tools/*.py`.
- Keep dependencies documented in nearest `requirements.txt`.
- Respect local desktop constraints documented in `rd-build/FINDINGS.md` and `rd-build/tools/SETUP.md`.
